# 🏥 Smart Medical Management System

A full-stack Django-based healthcare management platform that connects Patients, Doctors, Pharmacists, and Admin in one secure system with appointment booking, prescription management, medicine ordering, payment processing, inventory tracking, and real-time communication.

---

 🚀 Features

 👨‍⚕️ Doctor Module
- Doctor registration with admin approval
- Profile management with validation
- View and manage appointments
- Accept / Reject bookings
- Create digital prescriptions
- Assign medicines to pharmacists
- Search available medicines
- View completed consultations

 💊 Pharmacist Module
- Registration & verification system
- Add / Update / Delete medicines
- Stock & expiry date management
- Process prescription-based medicine sales
- Order confirmation workflow
- Profit calculation & sales reports
- Invoice generation
- Paid orders management

 👤 User Module
- Secure registration & login
- Profile management
- Book doctor appointments
- Online appointment payment
- View prescriptions
- Browse medicines
- Add medicines to cart
- Place medicine orders
- Order confirmation & invoice tracking

 🛠 Admin Module
- Approve / Reject doctors, pharmacists, users
- View all registered members
- Monitor medicine inventory
- Expired stock tracking
- Profit analytics dashboard
- Medicine sales reports

 💬 Communication
- Real-time Doctor ↔ Patient chat system

---

 🔒 Security & Validation
- Django authentication system
- Password hashing
- Role-based access control
- Email validation
- Phone validation
- Image upload validation
- Database transaction safety

---

 🛠 Tech Stack

- Backend: Django, Python
- Database: SQLite
- Frontend: HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, JavaScript
- Authentication: Django Auth
- ORM: Django ORM

---

 📌 Key Functionalities
✔ Appointment Scheduling  
✔ Digital Prescription System  
✔ Medicine Inventory Management  
✔ Online Payments  
✔ Pharmacy Order Workflow  
✔ Profit Tracking  
✔ Stock Expiry Monitoring  
✔ Real-Time Messaging  

---

 🎯 Project Outcome
Built a complete Healthcare ERP-style system automating hospital consultation, pharmacy workflow, prescription handling, and medicine commerce with secure multi-user access.

